-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",336,{
[10721]="7006BF79\n1\tScout the entrance to the Orc camp\030Scout the bend in the Orc camp\030Scout deeper in the camp\030Destroy Orkish weapons racks (total: 5)\tMizâdi has asked you to scout the Orc camp near the Span of Danagír, sabotaging the Orkish weapons racks as you go.\n2\tScout the back of the camp\tScout the back of the Orc camp.\n3\tDefeat the Utûgi Devastator\tDefeat the Utûgi Devastator.\n4\tReturn to Mizâdi in Urmâkh\tReturn to Mizâdi in Urmâkh with your report.\n",
[10722]="700077E9\n1\tDefeat goblins at the Sunken Stones (total: 3)\030Defeat goblins at the Goblinhole Ruins (total: 3)\tThe Sunken Stones are located south-east of Eldo Swatmidge's farm, east of Staddle. The Goblinhole Ruins are far to the east and south of the Sunken Stones. Watcher Redweed wants you to visit two ruins in the southern Midgewater Marshes and defeat goblins at each location to assess the threat the goblins pose to Staddle's well-being.\n2\tTalk to Bill Mossfoot\tBill Mossfoot is stationed south-east of the ruins of Midgewater Marsh. Redweed told you to report your findings at the ruins to Bill Mossfoot.\n",
[10723]="70002DED\n1\tTalk to Gwaemithrin\tThe scout Gwaemithrin is in the highlands north and east of Rivendell, at Glóin's camp. Ringhul has asked you to take Arifael's warning to Gwaemithrin and learn what she might know of the giants in the Misty Mountains.\n",
[10724]="70044288\n1\tSpeak with the first Gondorian warrior\tThe first Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should speak with the first Gondorian warrior.\n2\tTake a look around\tThe first Gondorian warrior can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should look around the area.\n3\tSpeak with the second Gondorian warrior\tThe second Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should speak with the second Gondorian warrior.\n4\tTake a look around\tThe second Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should look around the area.\n5\tSpeak with the third Gondorian warrior\tThe third Gondorian warrior can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should speak with the third Gondorian warrior.\n6\tTake a look around\tThe third Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should look around the area.\n7\tSpeak with the fourth Gondorian warrior\tThe fourth Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should speak with the fourth Gondorian warrior.\n8\tTake a look around\tThe fourth Gondorian warrior in Ingold's command can be found upon the northern Out-wall. You should look around the area.\n9\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[10725]="7000174C\n1\tScout the Hillman camp at the Eastern Ram Dúath\030Scout the pass through the Western Ram Dúath\tThe Hillman-encampment is north-east of Esteldín. The pass is west of the Hillman-encampment, north-west of an outcropping of spiny rocks. Melthindir has asked you to scout the Hillman-encampment and the pass through which the Hillmen approached to determine the severity of the threat they pose, so that the Rangers can plan a defence against them.\n2\tReturn to Melthindir\tMelthindir awaits your report at Esteldín. Angmarim forces have sent a small company of Hillmen to the south-east entrance of Ram Dúath. At the south-west entrance of Ram Dúath, you discovered evidence of many worms and drakes. You should return to Melthindir with your report.\n",
[10726]="7000104F\n1\tTalk to Elladan in Edhelion\tElladan is through the doorway east of Dorongúr Whitethorn. Dorongúr Whitethorn has sent you to speak with Elladan son of Elrond.\n",
[10727]="7001E9BF\n1\tCollect sack of discarded ore (total: 3)\tGarmadh-maudhûl lies to the north-east of Mithechad. Eirien has asked you to collect some of the ore discarded by the Orcs of Garmadh-maudhûl.\n2\tTalk to Eirien at Mithechad\tEirien is at Mithechad, south-west of Garmadh-maudhûl. You should bring the discarded ore to Eirien. Perhaps she will be able to see if this ore has been affected by the blight.\n",
[10728]="70028456\n1\tFind a friend near Nan Curunír\tNan Curunír lies to the north of the Ford of Isen. Grimbold has sent you to the Vale of Nan Curunír and suggested that you might find a friend awaiting you there.\n2\tFind the first patrol point\tNan Curunír stretches forth beyond Dagoras' camp. Dagoras has suggested that you scout the southern part of Nan Curunír.\n3\tFind the second patrol point\tNan Curunír stretches forth beyond Dagoras' camp. Dagoras has suggested that you scout the southern part of Nan Curunír.\n4\tFind the third patrol point\tNan Curunír stretches forth beyond Dagoras' camp. Dagoras has suggested that you scout the southern part of Nan Curunír.\n5\tFind the fourth patrol point\tNan Curunír stretches forth beyond Dagoras' camp. Dagoras has suggested that you scout the southern part of Nan Curunír.\n6\tTalk to Dagoras at his camp in Nan Curunír\tDagoras is encamped near the entrance to Nan Curunír. You should return to Dagoras and let him know what you have found.\n",
[10729]="70066EE9\n1\tGo to the way-crossing west of Tadrent, in King's Gondor, and look for danger on the road\tThe way-crossing is west of Tadrent. Guard Osbenn was supposed to go to the way-crossing west of Tadrent and look to ensure the roads were clear of danger, but now he is too exhausted to make the trip and asked you to do it.\n2\tWait for the newcomer to arrive\tSomeone approaches along the road.\n3\tTalk to Guard Dalmann at the way-crossing west of Tadrent, in King's Gondor\tGuard Dalmann has arrived at the way-crossing west of Tadrent.\n",
[10730]="70002E19\n1\tFind the Elves' marker\tThe Elves placed a white marker stone along the road to guide friends towards Barachen's camp. Alphlanc told you to seek a white marker stone eastward along the road.\n2\tTalk to Barachen\tBarachen is at his camp east of the Last Bridge, on a hill south of the road. Alphlanc asked you to bring word to Barachen that no evil has entered the Trollshaws while she has been watching the Last Bridge, though neither has any left.\n",
[10731]="7001E988\n1\tScout the eastern approach\030Scout the northern camp\030Scout the western approach\tÂnghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad. Harchador has asked you to explore the western and eastern approaches to the camp and a small camp directly across from the main rallying point at Ânghum-maudhûl.\n2\tTalk to Harchador at Mithechad\tHarchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl. You should return to Harchador and give your report on Ânghum-maudhûl.\n",
[10732]="7003E3B5\n1\tTalk to Narlinn\tNarlinn and Fimgris are encamped along the road, east of Barachen's camp. Barachen is impressed by your skill and determination and has asked you to lend your aid to the sons of Elrond, who keep watch over the Trollshaws from their camp near the Bruinen Gorges. He told you that Narlinn and Fimgris would be able to direct you to Thorenhad, where the sons of Elrond reside.\n",
[10733]="7002F842\n1\tFind Sergeant Hubyrt at Wakenflood\tSergeant Hubyrt can be found at Wakenflood. You should find Sergeant Hubyrt and offer your help to him.\n2\tFind and defeat an Easterling scouting party\tEasterling scouting parties can be found between Wakenflood and the Easterling encampment at the Anduin's edge. You should find and defeat an Easterling scouting party.\n3\tReturn to Sergeant Hubyrt of Wakenflood\tSergeant Hubyrt is at Wakenflood, attempting to hold a badly weakened outpost. You should return to Sergeant Hubyrt with news of the scouting party you defeated.\n",
[10734]="7002C8CB\n1\tTalk to Rothulf, who seems to have something important to tell you\tRothulf stands near Wynmar at the southern Rohirrim camp. Wynmar is distracted by his love for Noriel, but Rothulf has asked for a word with you.\n2\tDefeat any threats to the Rohirrim's camp (total: 5)\tRothulf suspects that a threatening presence can be found around Wynmar's camp in the south of Thinglad. You should search for and defeat any threats to the Rohirrim hunters.\n3\tStop the scouts' leader from sounding the alert\tA hardy leader of the Orc-scouts' initiative is likely somewhere near Wynmar's camp. You should try to defeat the scouts' leader before he can alert the attackers of the Rohirrim's whereabouts.\n4\tReturn to Rothulf with news of the Orc-threat\tRothulf is in Wynmar's camp in southern Thinglad. You should return to Rothulf with the dire news of the escaped scout.\n",
[10735]="70015788\n1\tTalk to Kalman at the Door to the Clouds\tKalman can be found at the small outpost found at the entrance to Zirakzigil in Durin's Way.\n2\tFind the bat-cave\tThe entrance to the bats' cave lies south and east of Durin's Crossing. Kalman has asked you to hunt down the bats that have infested Durin's Way.\n3\tDefeat bats (total: 12)\030Defeat morvul bat-handlers (total: 3)\tThe entrance to the bats' cave lies south and east of the entrance to Zirakzigil. Kalman has asked you to hunt down the bats that have infested Durin's Way.\n4\tTalk to Kalman at the entrance to Zirakzigil\tKalman is at the outpost near the entrance to Zirakzigil in Durin's Way, north and west of the bats' cave. You should return to Kalman with tidings of your success.\n",
[10736]="7001CD47\n1\tBring the blighted branch to Himeinior\tHimeinior is at Barad Angol, a small camp at a tower overlooking Sâd Doldúr. You should seek out Himeinior and give him the branch you found. Perhaps he can discern more about what is happening to the trees in the Ashenslades.\n",
[10737]="7006B60A\n1\tDeliver the scrolls to Amâsu in Iridír\tYou have been asked to deliver blank papyrus scrolls to a woman named Amâsu, who is in Iridír, a town in Ambarûl east of Mehêtur.\n",
[10738]="700660C0\n1\tTalk to Abartârik\tLothíriel has asked you to speak with Abartârik to see what they discovered at Hashadir. Abartârik is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.\n2\tDefeat frothing Hashadir rats (total: 6)\030Defeat scurrying Hashadir rats (total: 6)\tAbartârik has asked you to help drive out the rat population that has erupted in Hashadir. Hashadir is south of Dol Amroth.\n3\tReturn to Abartârik\tYou should let Abartârik know that you defeated many rats at Hashadir. Abartârik is in Dol Amroth outside of the Swan-knight's Keep.\n",
[10739]="7005293D\n1\tTravel to Blómgard in Laerlad\tBlómgard can be found at the edge of the southern wood of Laerlad in the Vales of Anduin. You should travel to Blómgard and see if you could be of any help there.\n2\tFind Odahild, the leader of Blómgard\tOdahild can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Odahild, the leader of Blómgard.\n3\tTalk to Odahild, leader of Blómgard\tOdahild can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Odahild, the leader of Blómgard.\n4\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[10740]="70036520\n1\tTalk to Gyric to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and speak with Wulfherr\tGyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw. You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and talk to Wulfherr to join the festivities.\n2\tTalk to Event Coordinator\tThe Event Coordinator is standing next to Wulfherr. You should speak with the Event Coordinator when you are ready to begin.\n3\tConsume food or drink (total: 10)\tTables with food may be found outside the gates of Scylfig. Eat as much food as possible before time runs out. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tSpeak with Wulfherr or Gyric.\t\n",
[10741]="700361B0\n1\tTalk to Gyric to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and speak with Wulfherr\tGyric is waiting for your decision in Forlaw. You should speak with Gyric when you are ready to travel to Scylfig in the Writhendowns and talk to Wulfherr to join the festivities.\n2\tUse the Scylfig bow\tUse the bow Wulfherr gave you to obtain your skills. Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course.\n3\tPoints: [see journal]\tTargets may be found throughout the course in the Writhendowns. Destroy targets to gain points towards the success of the celebration event. Note: This quest auto-completes upon beating the course. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10742]="70028C81\n1\tCollapse the cave entrance\tThe goblin-cave lies to the north of Cadthorn's position, along the ridge. Cadthorn has asked you to collapse the entrance of the goblin-cave.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, south of the goblin-cave. Cadthorn asked you to return to Ardwyn with news of your success.\n",
[10743]="7001B429\n1\tSeal Brungúr's barrow\030Seal the barrow of Thorún\030Seal the barrow of Mordeloth\tThe barrows lie to the north-east of Ivorel's camp. Ivorel asked you to shut the barrows of the Scuttledells and place seals of Elven-make upon them so that the fell spirits of Morgoth cannot rise up as wights.\n2\tTalk to Ivorel at her camp\tIvorel is at her camp, south-west of the barrows. You should return to Ivorel with news of your success.\n",
[10744]="7003FDE0\n1\tClose the gate\tTo close off the city from more corsair reinforcements, the gate at the top of the stairs must be closed.\n",
[10745]="700142F8\n1\tDefeat Moria soldiers in Snaga-maudhûl (total: 10)\tThe goblin-camp lies in the tunnels beyond the crack above the eastern stair. The dwarves want to end the goblins' reign over the tunnels below to ensure the safety and security of their foothold.\n2\tTalk to Wegil on the north-east side of Snaga-maudhûl\tWegil is on the north-east side of Snaga-maudhûl, standing watch on the road. You should find and speak with Wegil.\n",
[10746]="700082AC\n1\tTalk to Quartermaster Orgrin\030Collect Earth-kin Herb Satchel\tQuartermaster Orgrin is at Othrikar, north-west of Rusfold. Iivari has asked you to perform one final task for him: he wishes you to deliver a satchel of herbs to Orgrin, the provisioner at Othrikar, as fulfillment of a pact between Earth-kin and dwarves.\n",
[10747]="70032C24\n1\tExamine Puzzle Locket\030Search for the dwarves that headed east\tThe two dwarves, Knakk and Kafli, should be found somewhere to the east, around or beyond the Orcs' territory. You have been asked to find the dwarves Knakk and Kafli.\n2\tFind Knakk\tKnakk must have kept going after Kafli fell to the Orcs, but probably is not far away. He surely would not have wanted to leave his friend behind....\n",
[10748]="7002EEEA\n1\tDefeat Orc-searchers in the East Wall (total: 4)\tOrc-searchers can be found throughout the East Wall in the woods near Mansig's camp. Mansig is troubled by the unusual activity of the Orc-searchers in the East Wall.\n2\tTalk to Mansig\tMansig is at his camp in the East Wall. You have defeated Orc-searchers throughout the East Wall and should now return to Mansig.\n",
[10749]="70026730\n1\tDefeat Angmarim in Haudh Eldacar (total: 8)\tHaudh Eldacar is south-west of the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam asked you to venture within Haudh Eldacar and defeat the Angmarim within.\n2\tTalk to Rodlam in the Way of Kings\tRodlam is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Rodlam will want to know that you defeated many Angmarim in Haudh Eldacar.\n",
[10750]="7005A685\n1\tCollect diamonds (total: 12)\tDiamonds may be found on Orc-kind throughout Gundabad. You should collect diamonds for Bráthi.\n2\tReturn to Bráthi with the diamonds that you have collected\tBráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset. You should return to Bráthi with the diamonds that you have collected.\n",
[10751]="7005A687\n1\tCollect gold nuggets (total: 12)\tGold nuggets may be found on beasts throughout Gundabad. You should collect gold nuggets for Bráthi.\n2\tReturn to Bráthi with the gold that you have collected\tBráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset. You should return to Bráthi with the gold nuggets that you have collected.\n",
[10752]="7005A68A\n1\tCollect sapphires (total: 12)\tSapphires may be found on Men throughout Gundabad. You should collect sapphires for Bráthi.\n2\tReturn to Bráthi with the sapphires that you have collected\tBráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset. You should return to Bráthi with the sapphires that you have collected.\n",
})
